{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"A whole life studying and being studied. I will be normal. Average.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:22:26.423000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736453287678574603","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"It must be a relief.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:23:03.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736453444491280464","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"It is most terrifying. It is the thing I have longed for most. But what happens to me when I am among my people and I am homesick for England?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:24:19.236000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736453760850722827","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"I fear I may already have been cursed to a life without a true home.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:24:48.362000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736453883014152233","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"Well, you can always reminisce with us. We've lived in London our whole lives.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:25:13.971000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736453990425952387","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"I think I lot of people will feel that way. Up rooting our lives to go somewhere new. You won't be alone.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:26:10.995000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736454229602074675","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"✨Fuddles✨","id":"403783497564684291","is_bot":0,"username":"fuddlescottage"},"author_id":"403783497564684291","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"I bet we will all be homesick at one point or another.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:27:10.172000Z","edited_at":"2020-07-25T05:27:18.570000Z","id":"736454477808271490","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"bobicus","id":"185916549066915852","is_bot":0,"username":"bobicus"},"author_id":"185916549066915852","channel_id":"636017934723973133","content":"\"I suppose. It's just now that I'm about to get everything I've ever wanted, I'm spending my time thinking about how it could go wrong. Just a natural pessimism. A constitutional defect.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T05:28:07.270000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736454717294641203","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
